d energy in lively social encounters.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.sanguine.02","text":"I often respond quickly and positively to an interesting new idea.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.sanguine.03","text":"It is relatively easy for me to strike up a friendly conversation.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.sanguine.04","text":"Variety and new impressions help me stay engaged.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.choleric.01","text":"I often become more focused when a situation needs swift action.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.choleric.02","text":"I feel comfortable speaking plainly about a difficult matter.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.choleric.03","text":"A meaningful challenge can make me particularly energetic.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.choleric.04","text":"I naturally take initiative when others are waiting to decide.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.phlegmatic.01","text":"I tend to keep a steady pace even when others hurry.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.phlegmatic.02","text":"People often experience my presence as calm and reliable.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.phlegmatic.03","text":"I appreciate predictable routines that support long-term goals.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.phlegmatic.04","text":"I prefer listening and considering options before reacting.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.melancholic.01","text":"I notice emotional details that others may overlook.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.melancholic.02","text":"I often think carefully about the deeper meaning of an experience.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.melancholic.03","text":"I value precision and care when working on something important.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.melancholic.04","text":"Quiet reflection helps me understand what matters to me.","required":true}],"optionalContext":[],"suggestedRepeatDays":null,"contentHash":"sha256:c20a70040618f094adb4e71b94b642f1acd1a6ee612434b888a0ce4de27219b0"},{"id":"9721b16c-0401-5a31-8c01-000000000008","key":"hh-temperaments-16","version":"v1","instrumentLocale":"ru","translationVersion":"hh-original-ru-v1","timeframe":"general-self-description","scoringKey":"configured","scoringVersion":"v1","resultVersion":"v1","title":"Четыре классических темперамента","source":{"title":"Holistic House original reflective questionnaire (unvalidated)","permission":"original-holistic-house","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11","theoreticalBackground":"Holistic House original educational framework","interpretation":"Educational self-reflection only; not an official, validated, or clinical diagnostic instrument. Type candidates are tentative and can be ambiguous."},"answerScale":{"min":1,"max":5},"responseAnchors":["Совсем не согласен","Скорее не согласен","Ни согласен, ни не согласен","Скорее согласен","Полностью согласен"],"scoring":{"dimensions":[{"key":"trait.hh_temperament.sanguine","method":"sum","items":["temperament.sanguine.01","temperament.sanguine.02","temperament.sanguine.03","temperament.sanguine.04"],"min":4,"max":20,"dimensionClass":"trait","sourceConstruct":"Сангвинический / общительный","direction":"non-normative"},{"key":"trait.hh_temperament.choleric","method":"sum","items":["temperament.choleric.01","temperament.choleric.02","temperament.choleric.03","temperament.choleric.04"],"min":4,"max":20,"dimensionClass":"trait","sourceConstruct":"Холерический / решительный","direction":"non-normative"},{"key":"trait.hh_temperament.phlegmatic","method":"sum","items":["temperament.phlegmatic.01","temperament.phlegmatic.02","temperament.phlegmatic.03","temperament.phlegmatic.04"],"min":4,"max":20,"dimensionClass":"trait","sourceConstruct":"Флегматический / спокойный","direction":"non-normative"},{"key":"trait.hh_temperament.melancholic","method":"sum","items":["temperament.melancholic.01","temperament.melancholic.02","temperament.melancholic.03","temperament.melancholic.04"],"min":4,"max":20,"dimensionClass":"trait","sourceConstruct":"Меланхолический / рефлексивный","direction":"non-normative"}]},"questions":[{"id":"temperament.sanguine.01","text":"Оживлённое общение обычно даёт мне энергию.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.sanguine.02","text":"Я часто быстро и с воодушевлением реагирую на интересную идею.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.sanguine.03","text":"Мне сравнительно легко завязать дружелюбный разговор.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.sanguine.04","text":"Разнообразие и новые впечатления помогают мне сохранять интерес.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.choleric.01","text":"Когда нужны быстрые действия, я часто лучше сосредотачиваюсь.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.choleric.02","text":"Мне удобно прямо говорить о сложном вопросе.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.choleric.03","text":"Значимый вызов может сделать меня особенно энергичным.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.choleric.04","text":"Я естественно проявляю инициативу, когда остальные медлят с решением.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.phlegmatic.01","text":"Я склонен сохранять ровный темп, даже когда другие торопятся.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.phlegmatic.02","text":"Люди нередко воспринимают меня как спокойного и надёжного.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.phlegmatic.03","text":"Я ценю предсказуемые привычки, которые поддерживают долгосрочные цели.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.phlegmatic.04","text":"Я предпочитаю выслушать и рассмотреть варианты, прежде чем реагировать.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.melancholic.01","text":"Я замечаю эмоциональные нюансы, которые другие могут не видеть.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.melancholic.02","text":"Я часто глубоко размышляю о смысле пережитого.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.melancholic.03","text":"При работе над важным делом я ценю точность и тщательность.","required":true},{"id":"temperament.melancholic.04","text":"Спокойные размышления помогают мне понять, что для меня важно.","required":true}],"optionalContext":[],"suggestedRepeatDays":null,"contentHash":"sha256:2540945fab8da34bde976d0340a42642f244fb6538e8dbb3e6b0b069b8629a6f"}]$hh_personality$::jsonb)
  loop
    if exists(select 1 from app.assessment_versions where id=(d->>'id')::uuid and content_hash<>d->>'contentHash') then
      raise exception 'Conflicting immutable assessment version %',d->>'id';
    end if;
    insert into app.assessment_versions (
      id,definition_key,definition_version,instrument_locale,translation_version,
      definition,questions,answer_schema,scoring_key,scoring_version,
      result_schema,timeframe,source_metadata,content_hash
    ) values (
      (d->>'id')::uuid,d->>'key',d->>'version',d->>'instrumentLocale',d->>'translationVersion',
      d,d->'questions',jsonb_build_object('type','integer','minimum',1,'maximum',5),
      d->>'scoringKey',d->>'scoringVersion',jsonb_build_object('version',d->>'resultVersion'),
      d->>'timeframe',d->'source',d->>'contentHash'
    ) on conflict(id) do nothing;
  end loop;
end $$;
